WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.050
- I'm a PhD in molecular
biology turned mom,

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.810
obsessed with feeding my kids nutritious,

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.600
flavorful, fun food.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.910
Today, I'm gonna show you three easy ways

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.323
you can meal-prep for your picky eater.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.010
Exposing kids to a wide variety of foods

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.460
in different ways is really important.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:23.540
Buy foods you yourself
are super excited about.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.280
Shopping with your kids,
whether at the grocery store,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.120
the farmers market, such
a great way to give them

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.680
a sense of control.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:35.140
And I gotta always have on
hand my Happy Family Organics

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.500
fruit and veggie pouches.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.110
Great for when in a pinch,
adding new nutrition

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.953
and flavors to existing
foods that my kids love.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.000
Which kid doesn't love pancakes.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.840
Today, we're gonna make these oat, banana,

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.250
cinnamon pancakes, with the
Happy Family Organics pouch

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.630
with sweet potato,
pumpkin, pear, and banana.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.983
We're gonna start with a cup of oats.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.740
Get your kids to help you crack the eggs.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.040
Great way to get them
involved in the kitchen.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:08.600
The goal here is not to try to be sneaky

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.470
with the fruits and veggies.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.450
Talk to your kids about what you've put

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.640
in the pancake batter,
why it's exciting today.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.720
That's the texture that we like.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:19.920
It's smooth, but it still has
a little bit of a bite to it.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.860
So, when you start to see
tiny bubbles on the top,

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.080
you know that it's time to flip.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:25.913
There we go!

00:01:25.913 --> 00:01:27.190
Ooh, look at the color on that!

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:30.470
I love to serve these
pancakes with nature's candy,

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:32.663
also known as fresh fruit.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:35.910
A great way to get picky eaters

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.670
to eat a wide variety of foods,

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.490
is to take one food that they love,

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:42.420
to batch prep it, and then to
put it into different dishes.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:44.330
And we're gonna do exactly that,

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.000
with these five spice,
veggie-loaded meatballs.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.390
These meatballs are
great for picky eaters,

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:51.050
because they are veggie-loaded.

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:53.440
They have flavor in the form
of five spice, the onion,

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:55.870
the ginger, so you're
keeping their palates awake.

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:57.970
We're gonna add in the red onion.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.020
And you really just wanna soften this.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.970
You don't want to overcook it,
'cause it will burn quickly.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:07.220
There is nothing that makes me happier

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:10.640
than spending time in the
kitchen, whipping something up,

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.200
and having my kids enjoy it.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.843
It is the most exhilarating
moment for me in mom life.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:20.380
While the meatballs are in the oven,

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.250
we are gonna make our glaze.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:26.190
All we're gonna do is mix
soy sauce and orange juice.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.230
These meatballs have
become a staple on the menu

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.450
for every birthday party, play date,

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.450
and anytime my kids are going
through a picky eating phase.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.330
And with this set of
meatballs, you can make three

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.567
different dishes: egg
frittata muffins, quesadillas,

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:41.090
and a noodle soup.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.110
The Happy Family Organics pouches

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:46.300
were a real lifesaver for
me when my son was a toddler

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.050
and only wanted purees.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.980
Happy Family Organics
has this really valuable,

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.960
live-chat feature on their website,

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.710
where parents who are overwhelmed

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.780
with all this conflicting information

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.110
about what to feed and
not feed their kids,

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.480
can go for genuine advice.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.410
Parenting is no joke.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:06.660
Just embrace the chaos,
embrace the ups and downs,

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.410
and just realize that
we're all in this together.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:12.070
And it is one of the most
rewarding experiences

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.313
we will ever have.

